        "params": {
          "text": "MICROPHONE SPECTRUM  |  live sound from the default PipeWire input\nAudioSource captures stereo F32 at 48 kHz; the Live Oscilloscope shows the newest samples.\nRun continuously (the saved run is -1), double-click \"spectrum\", then choose the Spectrum tab.\nDevice-paced: model time follows the sound card. Lower the input gain if the trace clips at ±1.\nGuide: examples/audio/microphone_spectrum.md",
